                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_JapynQ": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "enable_custom_font": false,
                        "custom_class": "c",
                        "text": "<p>Yes - every miniature! Heroes, monsters, NPCs and giants can share the same bundle, and nothing here is a fixed set - if a mini is in our catalogue, it can go in.</p>",
