                        "text": "<p>We craft every mini to order, so your bundle is printed after you place it: 5 to 7 business days in the forge, then shipping (5-8 days inside the EU, 10-14 to the US, longer to Canada and Australia). You get a tracking number by email the moment it leaves us.</p>",
